<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"meta":{"adminLabel":{"desktop":{"value":"Family Story Text"}}},"decoration":{"spacing":{"desktop":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"30px","right":"30px","bottom":"30px","left":"30px","syncVertical":"on","syncHorizontal":"on"}}},"phone":{"value":{"padding":{"top":"20px","right":"20px","bottom":"20px","left":"20px","syncVertical":"on","syncHorizontal":"on"}}}},"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}}}},"content":{"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<div class=\"bd-family-story-content\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#353740;line-height:1.25em;letter-spacing:0.01em;\">Why Families Choose B.D Star Transport</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:#747d88;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55em;\">Our fleet includes spacious SUVs and vans that accommodate families of all sizes, with room for luggage and beach equipment. We offer 24/7 service, transparent pricing with no hidden fees, and easy booking through our website or WhatsApp.</p></div>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.11.1"} /-->
