<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"meta":{"adminLabel":{"desktop":{"value":"Trust Body & Grid"}}},"decoration":{"layout":{"desktop":{"value":{"display":"block"}}}}},"content":{"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<div class=\"bd-family-trust-body\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#353740;line-height:1.25em;letter-spacing:0.01em;\">Travel With Total Confidence</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-weight:400;color:#747d88;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55em;\">Every transfer is planned around your family&#8217;s comfort, safety, and flight schedule.</p><div class=\"bd-family-trust-grid\"><div class=\"bd-family-trust-item\"><div class=\"bd-family-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#141630\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.516 2.17a.75.75 0 00-1.032 0 11.209 11.209 0 01-7.877 3.08.75.75 0 00-.722.515A12.74 12.74 0 002.25 9.75c0 5.942 4.064 10.933 9.563 12.348a.749.749 0 00.374 0c5.499-1.415 9.563-6.406 9.563-12.348 0-1.39-.223-2.73-.635-3.985a.75.75 0 00-.722-.516l-.143.001c-2.996 0-5.717-1.17-7.734-3.08zm3.094 8.016a.75.75 0 10-1.22-.872l-3.236 4.53L9.53 12.22a.75.75 0 00-1.06 1.06l2.25 2.25a.75.75 0 001.14-.094l3.75-5.25z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-text\"><strong>Licensed &amp; Insured</strong><span>Full passenger insurance &amp; permits</span></div></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-item\"><div class=\"bd-family-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#141630\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 2.25c-5.385 0-9.75 4.365-9.75 9.75s4.365 9.75 9.75 9.75 9.75-4.365 9.75-9.75S17.385 2.25 12 2.25zM12.75 6a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0v6c0 .414.336.75.75.75h4.5a.75.75 0 000-1.5h-3.75V6z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-text\"><strong>10+ Years Experience</strong><span>Dedicated local airport drivers</span></div></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-item\"><div class=\"bd-family-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#141630\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m11.645 20.91-.007-.003-.022-.012a15.247 15.247 0 0 1-.383-.218 25.18 25.18 0 0 1-4.244-3.17C4.688 15.36 2.25 12.174 2.25 8.25 2.25 5.322 4.714 3 7.688 3A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 12 5.052 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 16.313 3c2.973 0 5.437 2.322 5.437 5.25 0 3.925-2.438 7.111-4.739 9.256a25.175 25.175 0 0 1-4.244 3.17 15.247 15.247 0 0 1-.383.219l-.022.012-.007.004-.003.001a.752.752 0 0 1-.704 0l-.003-.001Z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-text\"><strong>Child Safety Seats</strong><span>Pre-installed infant &amp; booster seats</span></div></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-item\"><div class=\"bd-family-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#141630\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10.788 3.21c.448-1.077 1.976-1.077 2.424 0l2.082 5.007 5.404.433c1.164.093 1.636 1.545.749 2.305l-4.117 3.527 1.257 5.273c.271 1.136-.964 2.033-1.96 1.425L12 18.354 7.373 21.18c-.996.608-2.231-.29-1.96-1.425l1.257-5.273-4.117-3.527c-.887-.76-.415-2.212.749-2.305l5.404-.433 2.082-5.006z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"bd-family-trust-text\"><strong>5-Star TripAdvisor</strong><span>Top rated Dominican transportation</span></div></div></div></div>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.11.1"} /-->
